    ""Need more help? Contact support"": ""需要更多帮助？联系支持服务"",",
Ghost,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/Ghost/pull/8,Missing interpolation variable in newsletter unsubscribe message,"The translation for the key '{memberEmail} will no longer receive {newsletterName} newsletter.' in portal.json is missing the {newsletterName} interpolation variable. The Chinese translation only includes '{memberEmail}将不会再收到新闻信。' which omits the newsletter name placeholder. This means when users unsubscribe from a specific newsletter, they won't see which newsletter they're unsubscribing from, leading to confusion and potential accidental unsubscriptions. The translation should include both {memberEmail} and {newsletterName} variables to match the English source and maintain functional parity.",ghost/i18n/locales/zh/portal.json,6.0,9.0,"    ""{amount} off forever."": ""永久减免{amount}"",
    ""{discount}% discount"": ""{discount}% 折扣"",
    ""{memberEmail} will no longer receive {newsletterName} newsletter."": ""{memberEmail}将不会再收到新闻信。"",
    ""{memberEmail} will no longer receive emails when someone replies to your comments."": ""{memberEmail}将不会再收到评论回复提醒邮件。"",",
Ghost,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/Ghost/pull/8,Translation inconsistency for 'Enter your name' field across UI contexts,"The PR introduces an inconsistency in the Chinese translation for the 'Enter your name' input field. In portal.json line 71, it's translated as '输入您的名字' (enter your first name), which suggests only a first name is needed. However, based on the context of Ghost's user registration and profile system, and the fact that the 'Name' field itself should be '姓名' (full name), this creates a mismatch between what the label asks for ('名字' - first name) and what the system actually expects ('姓名' - full name). This can cause user confusion during registration and profile completion, potentially leading to incomplete or incorrectly formatted name entries.",ghost/i18n/locales/zh/portal.json,68.0,72.0,"    ""Ends {offerEndDate}"": ""于{offerEndDate}结束"",
    ""Enter code above"": ""在上方输入验证码"",
    ""Enter your email address"": ""输入您的电子邮箱地址"",
    ""Enter your name"": ""输入您的名字"",
    ""Error"": ""错误"",",
Ghost,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/Ghost/pull/8,Deletion of comments.json breaks comments-ui build for Chinese locale,"The PR deletes ghost/i18n/locales/zh/comments.json, but this file is required by the comments-ui application build configuration. In apps/comments-ui/vite.config.mts line 56, the Vite build explicitly declares dynamicRequireTargets for comments.json across all SUPPORTED_LOCALES, including 'zh'. When the build system attempts to bundle the Chinese locale translations, it will fail because the required comments.json file no longer exists. This will break the build process for the comments-ui application or cause runtime failures when users try to view comments in Chinese.",,,,"diff --git a/ghost/i18n/locales/zh/comments.json b/ghost/i18n/locales/zh/comments.json
deleted file mode 100644
index 1de6b189e6..0000000000
--- a/ghost/i18n/locales/zh/comments.json
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,74 +0,0 @@
-{
-    ""{amount} characters left"": ""还剩{amount}字"",
-    ""{amount} comments"": ""{amount}条评论"",",
