aspnetcore,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/aspnetcore/pull/4,Unnecessary re-rendering on every parameter update with same display name,"The DisplayName component removed the check that prevents re-rendering when the display name hasn't changed (line 50-51). This means that every time SetParametersAsync is called with a changed expression (even if it results in the same display name), the component will trigger a render. This causes performance degradation in scenarios with frequent parameter updates, such as forms with dynamic field expressions, leading to unnecessary DOM updates and potential flickering in the UI.",src/Components/Web/src/Forms/DisplayName.cs,46.0,54.0,"if (For != _previousFieldAccessor)
