aspnetcore,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/aspnetcore/pull/4,E2E test method missing Arrange/Act/Assert comments,"This test method does not include the required '// Arrange', '// Act', and '// Assert' (or '// Act & Assert') comments to delineate phases.",src/Components/test/E2ETest/Tests/FormsTest.cs,560.0,586.0,"    [Fact]
    public void DisplayNameReadsAttributesCorrectly()
    {
