aspnetcore,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/aspnetcore/pull/9,XCode version mismatch with macOS image,"The build pipeline configures macOS-15 image but attempts to use XCode 15.2.0 instead of the required XCode 16.4.0. The display name shows 'Use XCode 16.4.0' but the actual command selects XCode 15.2.0. This mismatch will cause build failures on macOS-15 runners since XCode 15.2.0 is not available on macOS-15 images, only on macOS-13. The PR originally upgraded both the macOS image and XCode version together, but this bug breaks that pairing.",.azure/pipelines/jobs/default-build.yml,165.0,167.0,"      - ${{ if ne(parameters.agentOs, 'Windows') }}:
