cal.com,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/cal.com/pull/5,Missing bookingUrl initialization breaks Preview and Copy Link functionality,"The bookingUrl state variable is initialized but never populated from the fetched eventType data in applyEventTypeData(). The original PR added 'if (eventType.bookingUrl) setBookingUrl(eventType.bookingUrl);' to populate this state, but this line was removed. This causes handlePreview() and handleCopyLink() to always fail with 'Booking URL not available' error, even when the API returns a valid bookingUrl. Users cannot preview or copy links for their event types, breaking core functionality that was supposed to work with the new bookingUrl field from API V2.",companion/app/(tabs)/(event-types)/event-type-detail.tsx,451.0,460.0,"  const applyEventTypeData = useCallback((eventType: EventType) => {
    setEventTypeData(eventType);

    // Load basic fields
