...
jest.spyOn(calVideoService, ""getTranscripts"").mockResolvedValue([]);",All Tests Must Use Vitest Framework and UTC Timezone
dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/1,Legacy typing imports instead modern syntax,"The rule requires using Python 3.12+ modern type syntax (set[tuple[str, ...]] instead of Set[Tuple[str, ...]]), but the code imports and uses legacy typing module classes Set and Tuple",api/core/workflow/nodes/variable_assigner/v1/node.py,1.0,35.0,"from collections.abc import Mapping, Sequence
