            return
          }
        }",
dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/2,Dead store / unused variable `normalizedJsonSchema`,"SonarJS no-dead-store is enforced at error level. `normalizedJsonSchema` is assigned but never used afterwards, making it a dead store and a lint violation.",web/app/components/app/configuration/config-var/config-modal/index.tsx,234.0,236.0,"const jsonSchemaValue = tempPayload.json_schema
