dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/3,Missing None-check allows invalid template render result to propagate,"The validation logic in `render_template` was modified to skip type checking when `rendered` is None. The original code correctly rejected None values with 'Template render result must be a string', but the new condition `if rendered is not None and not isinstance(rendered, str)` allows None to pass through and be returned. This will cause AttributeError exceptions downstream when code attempts to call string methods like `len()` on the None value, breaking template transformation workflows that depend on always receiving a valid string output.",api/core/workflow/nodes/template_transform/template_renderer.py,38.0,40.0,"        rendered = result.get(""result"")
