dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/4,Session without context manager usage,"The rule requires all database sessions to use 'with Session(db.engine, expire_on_commit=False) as session:' pattern for proper resource management, but the code creates a session without a context manager and never closes it",api/services/conversation_variable_updater.py,18.0,23.0,"session = Session(db.engine)
