dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/10,Test function missing parameter and return type annotations,This new test function lacks a type annotation for `flask_app_with_containers` and has no return type annotation (typically `-> None`). Rule requires type hints for all parameters and return values. (Same issue applies to the other newly added `test_get_plan_bulk_with_cache_*` functions in this file.),api/tests/test_containers_integration_tests/services/test_billing_service.py,60.0,61.0,"def test_get_plan_bulk_with_cache_all_cache_hit(self, flask_app_with_containers):
