dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/11,Pydantic v1 Config class usage,"The rule requires data validation to use Pydantic v2 with ConfigDict(extra='forbid'), but this code uses Pydantic v1 'class Config' syntax with 'extra = allow' which permits undeclared fields",api/core/agent/base_agent_runner.py,52.0,65.0,"class AgentThoughtValidation(BaseModel):
