dify,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/dify/pull/13,Nested helper function missing type annotations,"This function definition lacks a type annotation for its parameter and return value, violating the requirement that all Python function definitions include type hints for parameters and return types.",api/tests/unit_tests/core/workflow/graph_engine/graph_traversal/test_skip_propagator.py,201.0,207.0,"def get_outgoing_edges_side_effect(node_id):
