firefox-ios,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/firefox-ios/pull/6,Mock class not marked final,"Per Rule 12, classes that are not intended for subclassing should be marked `final`. This mock type appears to be a concrete test helper and is modified in this PR, but remains non-final.",firefox-ios/firefox-ios-tests/Tests/ClientTests/Mocks/MockUserNotificationCenter.swift,6.0,6.0,"class MockUserNotificationCenter: UserNotificationCenterProtocol, @unchecked Sendable {",Classes That Should Not Be Subclassed Must Be Marked Final
