prefect,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/prefect/pull/4,Selected block document not found when search filter is active,"The `selectedBlockDocument` memo is incorrectly using `filteredData` instead of the original `data` array. When a user performs a search that doesn't match the currently selected block's name, the selected block will not be found in the filtered results, causing it to become undefined. This breaks the UI by displaying 'Select a block...' placeholder instead of showing the actual selected block name, even though a block is selected.",ui-v2/src/components/blocks/block-document-combobox/block-document-combobox.tsx,73.0,77.0,"const selectedBlockDocument = useMemo(() => {
