};",
prefect,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/prefect/pull/9,Unused import violates Rule #12 noUnusedImports configuration,"The flow-icon-text.tsx file imports Skeleton from '@/components/ui/skeleton' on line 6 but never uses it in the component code. This directly violates Rule #12 'Unused Imports Must Be Automatically Removed' from AGENTS.md, which requires that unused imports be eliminated via automated linting. The biome.json configuration explicitly sets noUnusedImports as an error, meaning this should have been caught by pre-commit hooks. The unused import increases bundle size unnecessarily and indicates the linting process was bypassed or failed.",,,,"import { useSuspenseQuery } from ""@tanstack/react-query"";
