prefect,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/prefect/pull/11,Test file in wrong directory structure,"The rule requires that for every source file at src/prefect/module/file.py, a corresponding test file exists at tests/module/test_file.py with the same relative path structure. However, the test file test_observer.py was placed in tests/unit/ instead of tests/ directly, breaking the mirroring convention.",src/integrations/prefect-kubernetes/tests/unit/test_observer.py,1.0,15.0,"import asyncio
