redis,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/redis/pull/1,Test function missing REDIS_TEST wrapper,"The rule requires that all test functions and test-specific code in source files must be enclosed within #ifdef REDIS_TEST / #endif blocks, but the validateStoredKeyConversion function is a test/validation function that exists without the required preprocessor wrapper",src/dict.c,101.0,108.0,"/* Validate that stored-key to key conversion works correctly */
