redis,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/redis/pull/3,Incorrect condition causes cross-slot check for keyless commands,"The condition was changed from `num_keys > 0` to `num_keys >= 0`, which incorrectly includes the case where num_keys equals 0. For keyless commands (num_keys == 0), the slot value may be uninitialized or contain arbitrary data from extractKeysAndSlot. The code will then spuriously check if this uninitialized slot equals CLUSTER_CROSSSLOT, potentially causing false positive cross-slot errors for legitimate keyless commands. This breaks the handling of keyless commands like PING, INFO, or SELECT in cluster mode.",src/server.c,4141.0,4147.0,"    } else if (num_keys >= 0) {
