redis,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/redis/pull/5,Internal helper function kvobjComputeSize is not declared static,"`kvobjComputeSize` appears to be an internal helper used within `src/object.c` (e.g., by the MEMORY USAGE handling code in the same file). Per the rule, such single-compilation-unit helper functions must be declared `static` to avoid exporting unnecessary global symbols.",src/object.c,1208.0,1208.0,"size_t kvobjComputeSize(robj *key, kvobj *o, size_t sample_size, int dbid) {",Rule 7: Internal Helper Functions Must Be Declared Static
