redis,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/redis/pull/6,Active defragmentation incorrectly forced ON after replication sync,"The code saves the original active_defrag_enabled value but then unconditionally sets it to 1 instead of restoring the original value. This means if active defragmentation was disabled before the replication sync (orig_active_defrag = 0), it will be incorrectly enabled after emptyData() completes. This breaks the intended behavior of preserving the user's defragmentation configuration and can cause unexpected performance degradation or memory operations on replicas that should not have defragmentation running.",src/replication.c,1956.0,1962.0,"    int orig_active_defrag = server.active_defrag_enabled;
