redis,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/redis/pull/8,Off-by-one error in field expiration comparison,"The expiration check uses strict greater-than (>) instead of greater-than-or-equal (>=) when comparing expiredAt with commandTimeSnapshot(). This causes fields that expire at exactly the current timestamp to be incorrectly treated as expired. In high-frequency operations, this can lead to premature field expiration and data loss, especially affecting the HINCRBYFLOAT operation's ability to preserve field TTL correctly.",src/t_hash.c,742.0,743.0,"    if (*expiredAt > (uint64_t) commandTimeSnapshot())
