tauri,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/tauri/pull/5,New/modified path resolution introduces panics/unwraps for fallible operations,"`resolve_dirs` uses `panic!` and `unwrap()` (`tauri.parent().unwrap()`) for fallible operations (project discovery/path parent resolution) instead of returning a `Result`, violating the rule to make failure explicit rather than panicking.",crates/tauri-cli/src/helpers/app_paths.rs,127.0,145.0,"pub fn resolve_dirs() -> Dirs {
