tauri,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/tauri/pull/9,Incorrect tauri version in metadata file,"The metadata-v2.json file specifies tauri version as ""2.8.2"" but the actual tauri crate version is ""2.8.3"" as shown in crates/tauri/Cargo.toml. This version mismatch will cause the CLI to report incorrect version information to tools and scripts that depend on this metadata. The PR updated the tauri version to 2.8.3, but the metadata file was not updated accordingly, creating an inconsistency between the actual library version and the advertised version.",crates/tauri-cli/metadata-v2.json,6.0,6.0,"{
