tauri,https://github.com/agentic-review-benchmarks/tauri/pull/9,Dependency version mismatch for tauri-bundler,"The tauri-cli Cargo.toml declares a dependency on tauri-bundler version ""2.6.0"", but the actual tauri-bundler crate version is ""2.6.1"" as specified in crates/tauri-bundler/Cargo.toml. This creates a version constraint mismatch that could cause build failures or prevent the CLI from using the updated bundler with the bug fix for 32-bit Windows builds. The CHANGELOG indicates this version should have been updated to 2.6.1 to pick up the binary patching fix.",crates/tauri-cli/Cargo.toml,50.0,50.0,"clap = { version = ""4"", features = [""derive"", ""env""] }
